== signature help
explicit constructor: Circle(float radius) {float radius} | active 0 parameter 0
method of a typed local: grow(float by): float {float by} | active 0 parameter 0
std function, second argument: repeat(string s, integer times): string {string s|integer times} | active 0 parameter 1
free builtin: parseInt(string text): integer {string text} | active 0 parameter 0
builtin member, second argument: substring(integer start, integer end): string {integer start|integer end} | active 0 parameter 1
overloads, second argument: scaled(float factor): float {float factor}; scaled(float factor, float extra): float {float factor|float extra} | active 1 parameter 1
overloads, first argument: scaled(float factor): float {float factor}; scaled(float factor, float extra): float {float factor|float extra} | active 0 parameter 0
implicit constructor from the fields: Point(float x, float y) {float x|float y} | active 0 parameter 0
nested call picks the inner one: area(): float {} | active 0 parameter 0
empty argument list: area(): float {} | active 0 parameter 0
sync statement is no call: (none)
outside any call: (none)
call inside an interpolation: 2 signatures, active 1 parameter 1
